            <span>PROJECT 01 · ANDROID AUTOMOTIVE OS</span>
            <span class="demo-tag">TEAM LEAD · JUL TO AUG 2026</span>
          </div>
          <div class="dossier-main">
            <div class="dossier-copy">
              <h3>
                Digital Cockpit Copilot<span class="title-slash">/</span><br
                />Manual RAG without hallucinations
              </h3>
              <p class="project-summary">
                When a driver asks "Why is warning light 14 blinking?" on the
                highway, the cockpit can't afford a 3-second delay or an invented
                answer. We built an in-cockpit voice assistant for Android
                Automotive OS to query 84 dense vehicle service manuals.
              </p>

              <div class="case-breakdown">
                <div class="case-item">
                  <span class="case-num mono">01</span>
                  <div class="case-text">
                    <strong>The Catch:</strong> Wiring schematics and fuse tables broke standard vector search, causing critical diagnostic lookups to miss 24% of queries.
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="case-item">
                  <span class="case-num mono">02</span>
                  <div class="case-text">
                    <strong>The Fix:</strong> Paired RapidOCR diagram parsing with hybrid BM25 + ChromaDB retrieval, reranked by Cross-Encoder with Reciprocal Rank Fusion.
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="case-item">
                  <span class="case-num mono">03</span>
                  <div class="case-text">
                    <strong>The Impact:</strong> Boosted retrieval accuracy to 100% on evaluation queries with sub-5ms intent routing.
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

